  (text "FIRST-PROTOTYPE RAIL EXCEPTION\n56k / 10k: 3.3 V nominal. No LDO.\nPWM static estimate: 3.256 to 3.344 V.\nLED source minimum is 3.3 V.\nLED operation is NOT guaranteed.\nTest startup, low battery, Wi-Fi and\nfull-white steps at the LED pins.\nSee power.md for limits and test gates."
